y exist in-platform.\n- Runs alongside the status-surfacing work in the same repo and team; the\n  shared list surface is a merge-coordination concern managed within the\n  team, not a blocking dependency.\n- Out of scope per strategy: alerting/notifications on status transitions,\n  status history / timeline views, and ModelMesh deployments (KServe\n  InferenceService only).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Given the deployed models list, when the user applies a status filter, then\n  only deployments with the selected status (Ready, Progressing, or Failed)\n  are shown (HLR-4).\n- Given the deployed models list, when the user sorts the list by status,\n  then deployments are ordered by status according to the selected sort\n  direction (HLR-4).\n- The deployed models list remains fully usable when no filter is applied\n  (no regression to the unfiltered list).\n- The Dashboard's existing build pipeline remains green with these changes.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-4 (P2): filter and sort the deployed models list by status — this epic\n  (split from the P0 status-surfacing work so the P2 capability can be\n  planned and deferred independently).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":33672,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83656c89cfe7cac2","agent_id":"a3db62b666f7aad26","session_id":"3b82bbf4-97d2-4391-a50a-11f44f5d64aa","uuid":"46b1d515-60d2-4fc0-9f85-dec38006962c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:27:26.369Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9001 decomposition"}
